      "parameters": {},
      "rule": "The car is kept entirely off the symmetrical primary facade: a detached outbuilding, or a service wing set well back and below the main cornice line, so nothing competes with the portico's axis. No historical precedent exists for this element; this is an editorial extension of the style's own strict-bilateral, portico-dominant composition.",
