          "note": "Inherited from Beaux-Arts-American; the style's own defining_characteristics gives only 'a continuous cornice, often with a balustrade or parapet' -- a plain railing, not the sculptural skyline Beaux-Arts specifies."
        }
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "height_min_in": {
          "value": 30,
          "unit": "in",
